WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.400
Have you ever interacted with a chatbot that can't&nbsp;
seem to figure out what you need and responds with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:11.040
"I'm sorry I don't understand. Please try again."&nbsp;
Yeah, we've all been there with a rules-based&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:17.100
chatbot, when a simple task of ordering something&nbsp;
turns into a headache. Are rules-based chatbots&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:22.620
obsolete? No! But let's look at three different&nbsp;
kinds of chatbots with various degrees of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:30.480
sophistication: the rules-based, AI-powered, and&nbsp;
generative AI. Which is the right kind for your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:34.920
company? The answer is "it depends".
Let's look at our first example,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:40.860
the limited rules-based chatbot, which walks&nbsp;
the customer through a rigid, predetermined&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:45.180
flow and operates on basic keyword detection.
[chatbot] Thanks for choosing Taste of Italy.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:48.600
Our pizzas are yummy! How many&nbsp;
pizzas would you like to order?&nbsp;

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.880
[Bella] Two.
[chatbot] What size would you like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:54.240
them to be? Small, medium, or large.
[Bella] Large.&nbsp;

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:59.700
As you can see, there's not much AI&nbsp;
involved in this interaction. Of course,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:05.220
placing an order is not always so straightforward.&nbsp;
Because it's impossible for the conversation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:09.900
designer to predict and pre-program the chatbot&nbsp;
for all the ways a person can place an order,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:16.620
this kind of chatbots often get stuck. [Bella] My pizza is cold! I want to file a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:19.740
complaint and get my money back!
[chatbot] Sorry, I don't understand,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:24.180
try rephrasing your message.
Also, if the customer has a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:28.380
complaint about the order, the chatbot&nbsp;
could act as a gatekeeper. This is a sure&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:33.420
way to send customers to competition.&nbsp;
Let's start the conversation again,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:39.300
this time with an AI-powered chatbot!
[Bella] I want to order two large&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:41.700
pepperoni and cheese pizzas.
[chatbot] Great choice,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:46.260
Bella! Would you like any extra toppings?
[Bella] No, just the regular, thanks! Add&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:51.720
one apple juice and one beer to the order.
With AI and natural language understanding [NLU]&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:57.180
capabilities, the chatbot can understand the&nbsp;
customer's request, the first time—no matter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.180 --> 00:02:03.240
how it's phrased. With deep learning, the longer&nbsp;
an AI chatbot has been in operation, the better&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:09.000
it can understand the intention behind questions&nbsp;
and provide more detailed, accurate responses.&nbsp;

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:12.000
Let's continue:
[chatbot] We have a new offer – order&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:16.980
1 pizza and 1 dessert, and get a drink for free.&nbsp;
Would you like to take advantage of this?&nbsp;

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:20.700
[Bella] Of course, who doesn't like dessert?
[chatbot] Where would you like this order to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:21.780
be delivered?
[Bella] Home&nbsp;

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:24.196
[chatbot] Confirming 2 promotional packages.&nbsp;

00:02:24.196 --> 00:02:27.780
Delivery in 45 minutes. Enjoy dinner, Bella!&nbsp;

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:32.520
Deeply integrated with the business systems, the&nbsp;
chatbot knows the customer's name and address,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:35.100
presents the latest offers&nbsp;
that might be of interest,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:41.340
and creates a smooth ordering process.
[Bella] My pizza is cold! I want to file&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:44.940
a complaint and get my money back!
[chatbot] I am sorry to hear that. I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:47.580
am transferring you to a live&nbsp;
agent who can help you now.&nbsp;

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:53.460
When the customer is unhappy and wants to speak&nbsp;
to a human, the transfer should happen seamlessly.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:59.040
After being transferred, the live support agent&nbsp;
will get the chatbot conversation history and can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:05.400
start the call informed. But what would this&nbsp;
look like with a generative AI chatbot? Would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:09.480
the customer want to read a&nbsp;
chatbot-generated poem about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:12.780
pizza when placing an order?
[Bella] I want to order&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:17.460
two large pepperoni and cheese pizzas.
[chatbot] In this vibrant city's culinary scene,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:21.900
lies a pizza divine, a flavor supreme.&nbsp;
Would you like to order a pizza today?&nbsp;

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:28.260
Hmm, that's certainly added personality, but&nbsp;
probably not all that helpful in this case.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:34.140
Ok, let's start over. How can generative&nbsp;
AI elevate the customer's experience?&nbsp;

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:38.760
[Bella] Today I'm celebrating my&nbsp;
college graduation! I want to order&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.760 --> 00:03:42.840
two large pepperoni and cheese pizzas.
[chatbot] Nice to see you again Bella,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:47.640
and congratulations! No party meal is complete&nbsp;
without something sweet! We have the most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:53.700
delicious tiramisu cake and a new offer – order 1&nbsp;
pizza and 1 dessert, and get a drink for free. Would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:56.460
you like to take advantage of this?
[Bella] You bet!&nbsp;

00:03:57.540 --> 00:04:03.480
The next generation of generative AI chatbots can&nbsp;
get even smarter and more fluent in understanding&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:09.060
common language, adapting to the customer's style&nbsp;
of conversation, and using empathy when answering.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:15.240
You can optimize the chatbot response even further&nbsp;
using generative AI capabilities for search.&nbsp;

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:18.120
Let's see how:
[Bella] I have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:22.560
an allergy to peanuts. Can you confirm that&nbsp;
this dessert does not contain any peanuts?&nbsp;

00:04:22.560 --> 00:04:27.420
[chatbot] This tiramisu does not contain&nbsp;
any ingredients with peanuts. I searched&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:31.920
my knowledge base. You can expand to see&nbsp;
all the ingredients and what they contain.&nbsp;

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:36.960
Chatbots with conversational search capabilities&nbsp;
can give you answers to the questions you're&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:41.160
looking for, while showing you the source if&nbsp;
you want to validate the chatbot's response.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.700 --> 00:04:48.120
So, do chatbots need AI? Well, yes, it does make&nbsp;
chatbots smarter. They can better understand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:53.520
intent and respond more accurately to questions&nbsp;
by learning from its previous interactions,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:58.740
improving customer experiences. When thinking&nbsp;
about generative AI's impact on chatbots,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:04.020
think about how you can take advantage of&nbsp;
creative, conversational responses and when this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:08.100
technology makes the most sense for your business&nbsp;
objectives and the needs of your customers.

00:05:09.202 --> 00:05:10.408
Thanks again for watching.

00:05:10.408 --> 00:05:16.376
Head to watsonx Assistant to learn more about how to
leverage AI chatbots in your business.

